        name: "Nova Circuit",
        variantType: "STEVE",
        version: "1.0.0"
    },
    data: {
        ActionData: {
            ActionEventSet: {
                ON_INTERACTION: [
                    {
                        Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        ArmorDropChances: [0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f],
        ArmorItems: [
            {},
            {},
            {},
            {}
        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "safari_liberated"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 40,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Listen. That hum in the grass is what a preserve is supposed to sound like. Darik has the intake counter and Varek keeps the rules - go run a round, you have more than earned one."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Helga stood at the gate for an hour and then opened it to everyone. Rounds are running again - Darik signs you in, Varek talks you through the rules, and the owner herself will tell you the name of everything you meet."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I filed one report in my whole career that mattered, and you wrote most of it. The Preserve belongs to itself. Go enjoy it - Darik and Varek will set you up, and Helga will not stop thanking you either."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Nova Circuit - the Preserve breathes",
                    Label: "thanks"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "defeated_silva_longscope"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_safari_liberated"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 30,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Report the Preserve cleared",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/payout {amount:400}"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "loot give @s loot cobblemon_initiative:npc_gift/uncommon"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add safari_liberated"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "title @initiator title [{\"text\":\"RIDGEWATCH PRESERVE LIBERATED\",\"color\":\"gold\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "title @initiator subtitle [{\"text\":\"ACQUISITION reversed - every specimen is a creature again, and the ledger has no line for that\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Nova Circuit tears the intake placard off the fence - the Preserve belongs to itself again, and Helga is already unlocking the gate.\",\"color\":\"green\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "report_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "One moment more",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The Acting Manager just walked past me carrying a box of desk things and an empty clipboard. That was the last of them. Say the word, ranger to ranger, and I file the only report that ever mattered: the Preserve is a preserve again."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Nova Circuit - the last clipboard",
                    Label: "turn_in"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "I will drive them out.",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add safari_quest_started"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "start_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not yet",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Ranger Nova Circuit - what is left of the ranger service here, anyway. The Company annexed the whole Preserve as a specimen acquisition site. Two clipboards hold it: a Requisition Officer at the gate post, and behind him an Acting Manager who signs for everything. Drive them out - the officer first, the Manager after - and this place breathes again."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The staff will not move. Darik and Varek are good people with families, and the Company knows the word transition frightens better than any fence. So it comes down to whoever is still willing. Beat the Requisition Officer at the gate post, then the Acting Manager - in that order, the Manager takes no meetings while the perimeter stands."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "One more thing while you are counting problems: a trophy hunter called Marek is skulking at the north fence with a cart of things that should not be for sale. Not Company - just a vulture that smelled a wounded preserve. He is not the mission. The clipboards are: Requisition Officer first, then the Acting Manager."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Nova Circuit - ranger, mostly retired by force",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
